{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.avif?t=1772205011\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.webp?t=1772205011 width=1560 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized</strong> is a <strong>single-player, 3D top-down Roguevania</strong> (roguelite runs + metroidvania progression) where you play as <strong>The Seed of Life</strong>, a living creature evolving through dangerous biological realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition is a <strong>run</strong>: venture out from <strong>Sanctuary</strong>, shape a build through <strong>temporary mutations</strong>, and survive as a deadly <strong>Storm</strong> escalates pressure. When extraction becomes available, you\u2019ll face the core decision of Evolized: <strong>bank your rewards now\u2026 or push deeper for greater gains</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet Eieg\u00f4r is trapped in repeating extinction cycles caused by catastrophic storms, but something is controlling them. As <strong>The Seed of Life</strong>, you must survive, evolve, and uncover the truth behind the cycle to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature-based combat:</strong> you play the creature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolution-driven builds:</strong> adapt your playstyle through <strong>run-only mutations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storm-driven pacing:</strong> escalating danger that forces tough choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction risk/reward:</strong> leave safely or gamble for stronger rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted realms + persistent progression:</strong> unlock new routes with permanent <strong>Adaptations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong biological identity:</strong> plant / animal / fungus-inspired realms and threats</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435700?t=1772205011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435700?t=1772205011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/bd31068e954ed4c307ea409b7068ada9d2e3d9eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772205011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/bd31068e954ed4c307ea409b7068ada9d2e3d9eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772205011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.avif?t=1772205011\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/extras_big/a74a030dec7373e054fbb7914f71c48c.webp?t=1772205011 width=1560 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolized</strong> is a <strong>single-player, 3D top-down Roguevania</strong> (roguelite runs + metroidvania progression) where you play as <strong>The Seed of Life</strong>, a living creature evolving through dangerous biological realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition is a <strong>run</strong>: venture out from <strong>Sanctuary</strong>, shape a build through <strong>temporary mutations</strong>, and survive as a deadly <strong>Storm</strong> escalates pressure. When extraction becomes available, you\u2019ll face the core decision of Evolized: <strong>bank your rewards now\u2026 or push deeper for greater gains</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet Eieg\u00f4r is trapped in repeating extinction cycles caused by catastrophic storms, but something is controlling them. As <strong>The Seed of Life</strong>, you must survive, evolve, and uncover the truth behind the cycle to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature-based combat:</strong> you play the creature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolution-driven builds:</strong> adapt your playstyle through <strong>run-only mutations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storm-driven pacing:</strong> escalating danger that forces tough choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction risk/reward:</strong> leave safely or gamble for stronger rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted realms + persistent progression:</strong> unlock new routes with permanent <strong>Adaptations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong biological identity:</strong> plant / animal / fungus-inspired realms and threats</p></li></ul>","developers":["Infinity Branch Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435700/702d5fd2387282b809c37df4ffd0c6c0158062ea/header.jpg?t=1772205011","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Infinity Branch Studios . All Rights Reserved.","linux_requireme